  "player_hint_1_en": "Suppose Albert were at row 2, column 8: then Hugo would have nowhere left to go. So Albert can't be there. Suppose Albert were at row 1, column 7: then Elsa would have nowhere left to go. So Albert can't be there. Testing the remaining squares the same way rules out a few more. So Albert (A) must be at row 2, column 7. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_2_en": "With the rows and columns of Albert crossed out, only one square is left for Hugo that fits his clue (\"He was beside the box.\"). So Hugo (H) must be at row 1, column 8. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_3_en": "Cedric can't be at row 3, column 9; row 4, column 9: in each case Gus would have nowhere left to go. Suppose Cedric were at row 4, column 4: then Fergus would have nowhere left to go. So Cedric can't be there. Testing the remaining squares the same way rules out a few more. Cedric's own clue (\"Someone else in his area was beside a table.\") rules out more squares. So Cedric (C) must be at row 3, column 5. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_4_en": "Suppose Daisy were at row 8, column 9: then Gus would have nowhere left to go. So Daisy can't be there. Daisy can't be at row 9, column 4; row 9, column 9: in each case Fergus would have nowhere left to go. Testing the remaining squares the same way rules out a few more. So Daisy (D) must be at row 6, column 4. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_5_en": "Suppose Elsa were at row 8, column 6: then Cedric would have nowhere left to go. So Elsa can't be there. So Elsa (E) must be at row 4, column 6. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_6_en": "Suppose Fergus were at row 9, column 2: then Victor would have nowhere left to go. So Fergus can't be there. So Fergus (F) must be at row 9, column 1. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_7_en": "Suppose Gus were at row 5, column 9: then Victor would have nowhere left to go. So Gus can't be there. So Gus (G) must be at row 7, column 9. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_8_en": "Bianca is now the only person who can still go in row 5. So Bianca (B) must be at row 5, column 2. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_9_en": "With the rows and columns of everyone placed so far crossed out, only one square is left for Victor. So Victor (the victim) must be at row 8, column 3. Cross out his row and column. Fergus is the only person in the Dock with Victor, so Fergus is the murderer!"
 },
